msgstr "{adapter} 运行时加载失败 — 请重新安装应用，或在源码目录中运行 npm install"

#. Adapter requirement; the adapter's name and the platform and architecture stay as they are
#: src/config.ts
msgid "the {adapter} SDK publishes no executable for {platform}-{arch}"
msgstr "{adapter} SDK 未发布适用于 {platform}-{arch} 的可执行文件"

#. A failed authoring turn that carried no message; {status} is the runtime's own status word and stays as it is
#: src/authoring.ts
msgid "the agent ended with status {status}"
msgstr "智能体以状态 {status} 结束"

#. Refusal of a remote URL carrying a user before the host
#: src/space-git.ts
msgid "The app stores no credential: remove everything before the host from the URL and use an SSH key or the machine's credential helper instead."
msgstr "应用不保存任何凭据：请从 URL 中删去主机之前的全部内容，改用 SSH 密钥或本机的凭据助手。"

#. Refusal of a remote URL carrying a user and a secret
#: src/space-git.ts
msgid "The app stores no credential: remove the user and secret from the URL and use an SSH key or the machine's credential helper instead."
msgstr "应用不保存任何凭据：请从 URL 中删去用户名和密钥，改用 SSH 密钥或本机的凭据助手。"

#. The toolchain's guidance when the shipped compiler and the app disagree on the playbook engine; the values read like `ABI 1, schemas 3` or `unreadable`; `@sublang/slc` and `@sublang/playbook` are package names, as they are
#: src/compile.ts
msgid "The app's compiler targets playbook engine {compiler} while the app runs {app}; update @sublang/slc and @sublang/playbook together."
msgstr "应用自带的编译器面向 Playbook 引擎 {compiler}，而应用运行的是 {app}；请同时更新 @sublang/slc 与 @sublang/playbook。"

#. The toolchain's guidance when the compiler the app ships is not installed; `@sublang/slc` is a package name and `npm ci` a command, both as they are
#: src/compile.ts
msgid "The app's own copy of @sublang/slc is missing; run npm ci in the Spex checkout to restore it."
msgstr "应用自带的 @sublang/slc 副本缺失；请在 Spex 源码目录中运行 npm ci 以恢复。"

#. Attachment transfer or storage diagnostic
#: src/session.ts
msgid "The attachment changed before it could be submitted. Retry the upload."
msgstr "附件在提交前发生了变化，请重新上传。"

#. The session's Captain, named inside a settings-drift line
#: src/session.ts
msgid "the Captain"
msgstr "Captain"

#. Refusal before the compiler runs: the block's adapter has no slc id; the adapter names and `SLC_AGENT` stay as they are
#: src/compile.ts
msgid "The compile's agent runs on {adapter}, which the compiler cannot drive; choose an agent on claude, codex, gemini or opencode, or set SLC_AGENT."
msgstr "编译所用的智能体运行在 {adapter} 上，而编译器无法驱动它；请选用 claude、codex、gemini 或 opencode 上的智能体，或设置 SLC_AGENT。"

#. Draft thread error; Settings is the surface's own name
